  <RHAH_Incident_BanditAttack_Label>Bandit attack</RHAH_Incident_BanditAttack_Label>
  <RHAH_BanditAttack_LetterText>A group of desperate ratkin has turned to banditry. They are coming to attack you and steal your supplies.</RHAH_BanditAttack_LetterText>
